  "description": "Bowire mock server — replays Bowire recordings as a live local API endpoint. Supports REST + gRPC unary replay, SSE / WebSocket / SignalR / MQTT streaming replay with captured frame cadence, schema-only mocks (OpenAPI / proto FileDescriptorSet / GraphQL SDL), chaos injection (latency, fail-rate), stateful cursors, and capture-on-miss for spec-by-example. Run via `bowire mock --recording <file>` or embed with `app.UseBowireMock(...)`.",
